WEBVTT

00:14:29.007 --> 00:14:31.342
Tas ir 700 reiz 666, plus 17 kvadrātā

00:14:31.366 --> 00:14:33.976
ir 466 489, ātrāk, ja vajag,

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.381
ātrāk, paņemam 466,

00:14:36.405 --> 00:14:39.532
pievienojam to skaldīšanai, lai dabūtu,

00:14:39.556 --> 00:14:41.564
ak vai,

00:14:41.588 --> 00:14:45.976
328 489.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.976
Publika: Jā!
A.B.: Labi.

00:14:48.000 --> 00:14:49.356
Liels paldies.

00:14:49.380 --> 00:14:50.976
(Aplausi)

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.489
Ceru, jums patika burvjemātika.

00:14:52.513 --> 00:14:53.514
Paldies.

00:14:53.538 --> 00:14:56.391
(Aplausi)